              (the right
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/coprojection"} coprojection
              into the
              = succeed ")." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/coproduct"} coproduct
          %p The final consistency condition (i.e. the remaining “monad law”) then is that “carrying along trivial effects is indeed the trivial operation”, i.e. that
          #eq:UnitalityInIntroduction.maruku-equation
            %span.maruku-eq-number (5)
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
