          %blockquote
            %p
              Traditionally in
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/category+theory"} category theory
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/axioms"} axioms
              on
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/monads"} monads
              are presented in a somewhat different way, invoking a monad “product”
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/natural+transformation"} natural transformation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
