                are data structures that
                %em provide
                (
                %em> co-handle
                ) such context.
          %p In more detail:
          %ul
            %li
              %p Above we had that:
              %ul
                %li
                  %p
                    A
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kleisli+map"} Kleisli map
                    for a
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/monad"} monad
